  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: stack overrun on deeply nested GeometryCollection in\n     ST_GeomFromText\n     - debian/patches/MDEV-40409.patch: check the thread stack before\n       parsing each nested collection\n     - MDEV-40409\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: stack overrun on deeply nested GeometryCollection in\n     ST_GeomFromWKB\n     - debian/patches/MDEV-40540.patch: check the thread stack before\n       reading each nested collection\n     - MDEV-40540\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: unbounded recursion on nested parentheses in ExtractValue\n     XPath expressions\n     - debian/patches/MDEV-39750.patch: check the thread stack before\n       parsing each parenthesized expression\n     - MDEV-39750\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: galera_recovery ran the server with --wsrep_recover as\n     root at service start\n     - debian/patches/MDEV-40629-galera-recovery-as-mysql.patch: drop\n       PermissionsStartOnly and run galera_recovery inside ExecStart as the\n       mysql user, keep only the run directory and debian-start steps\n       privileged\n     - MDEV-40629",
